WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.583 --> 00:00:32.416
For progress on the path of yoga,

2
00:00:32.416 --> 00:00:35.791
it is essential that a person 
understands their mind,

3
00:00:35.791 --> 00:00:37.166
understands the crises

4
00:00:37.166 --> 00:00:38.333
that arise from it,

5
00:00:38.333 --> 00:00:40.958
and also knows the capabilities
 of that same mind.

6
00:00:40.958 --> 00:00:43.958
This verse is related to this.

7
00:00:48.958 --> 00:00:50.791
In this verse, Lord Krishna

8
00:00:50.791 --> 00:00:53.458
is using the word ātmā,

9
00:00:53.458 --> 00:00:56.250
here ātmā means the mind.

10
00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:58.041
And this mind of a person has

11
00:00:58.041 --> 00:01:01.375
an important contribution 
in the practice of yoga.

12
00:01:01.375 --> 00:01:03.750
Lord Krishna says in this verse

13
00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:04.833
that a person's mind can be

14
00:01:04.833 --> 00:01:08.125
both their friend and their enemy.

15
00:01:08.125 --> 00:01:10.375
Therefore, a person must uplift themselves

16
00:01:10.375 --> 00:01:12.208
through this mind

17
00:01:12.208 --> 00:01:14.541
and avoid downfall.

18
00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:15.416
This same mind

19
00:01:15.416 --> 00:01:16.375
can keep a person bound

20
00:01:16.375 --> 00:01:18.375
in material attachments,

21
00:01:18.375 --> 00:01:19.250
and this same mind

22
00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:20.083
can also prove helpful

23
00:01:20.083 --> 00:01:21.291
in delivering them liberation

24
00:01:21.291 --> 00:01:24.041
from the worldly cycle.

25
00:01:24.041 --> 00:01:26.583
If the mind is not controlled,

26
00:01:26.583 --> 00:01:29.083
it will be attracted to all things related to

27
00:01:29.083 --> 00:01:31.791
sensory pleasures,

28
00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:33.375
and will trap the soul

29
00:01:33.375 --> 00:01:34.166
in the swamp of material

30
00:01:34.166 --> 00:01:37.166
desires and attachments.

31
00:01:37.166 --> 00:01:39.208
As soon as one desire is satisfied,

32
00:01:39.208 --> 00:01:41.083
another desire will awaken,

33
00:01:41.083 --> 00:01:42.750
after the second, a third,

34
00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:45.625
and this cycle will just keep going.

35
00:01:45.625 --> 00:01:46.708
Gradually this ego will awaken

36
00:01:46.708 --> 00:01:49.958
in a person that they must gain ownership

37
00:01:49.958 --> 00:01:53.416
of more and more material pleasures.

38
00:01:53.416 --> 00:01:56.125
In such a case, the soul, instead of being liberated,

39
00:01:56.125 --> 00:01:56.666
will remain trapped

40
00:01:56.666 --> 00:01:59.916
in the maze of ignorance and sorrow.

41
00:01:59.916 --> 00:02:02.250
On the other hand, that same mind,

42
00:02:02.250 --> 00:02:03.875
if kept under control

43
00:02:03.875 --> 00:02:06.916
and focused on higher spiritual purposes,

44
00:02:06.916 --> 00:02:08.541
will become the means of the soul's

45
00:02:08.541 --> 00:02:10.958
liberation and salvation.

46
00:02:10.958 --> 00:02:11.750
And now

47
00:02:11.750 --> 00:02:13.208
a natural thought

48
00:02:13.208 --> 00:02:15.125
must have arisen in the mind –

49
00:02:15.125 --> 00:02:17.041
then how should the mind be

50
00:02:17.041 --> 00:02:18.791
kept controlled?

51
00:02:18.791 --> 00:02:22.708
This will happen through the practice of yoga.

52
00:02:22.708 --> 00:02:24.125
Through yoga,

53
00:02:24.125 --> 00:02:27.000
a person learns discipline and restraint,

54
00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:29.666
learns to control this mind,

55
00:02:29.666 --> 00:02:33.083
learns to turn it away from material cravings

56
00:02:33.083 --> 00:02:35.750
and direct it toward spirituality.

57
00:02:40.416 --> 00:02:42.208
Your mind

58
00:02:42.208 --> 00:02:44.791
is very powerful.

59
00:02:44.791 --> 00:02:49.333
It can take you to the peak of success,

60
00:02:49.333 --> 00:02:51.708
but it can also

61
00:02:51.708 --> 00:02:54.791
pull you down and throw you into the pit

62
00:02:54.791 --> 00:02:58.458
of failure.

63
00:02:58.458 --> 00:03:02.333
Controlling it is essential.

64
00:03:02.333 --> 00:03:04.458
"I am incapable."

65
00:03:04.458 --> 00:03:07.166
"I will only fail."

66
00:03:07.166 --> 00:03:11.375
Your mind will say many such things.

67
00:03:11.375 --> 00:03:13.500
If you let such negative

68
00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:17.041
thoughts dominate your life,

69
00:03:17.041 --> 00:03:20.291
they will block your progress,

70
00:03:20.291 --> 00:03:22.666
lower your self-confidence.

71
00:03:22.666 --> 00:03:24.041
This is like

72
00:03:24.041 --> 00:03:27.750
harming yourself.

73
00:03:27.750 --> 00:03:29.208
Be aware,

74
00:03:29.208 --> 00:03:35.125
it's not necessary that you listen to every
 negative thing your mind says

75
00:03:35.125 --> 00:03:39.333
and start believing it too.

76
00:03:39.333 --> 00:03:41.625
Within you exists the capacity to give

77
00:03:41.625 --> 00:03:45.208
positive responses too.

78
00:03:45.208 --> 00:03:48.750
If the mind starts to dampen enthusiasm,

79
00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:51.041
give a positive answer.

80
00:03:51.041 --> 00:03:52.541
Control this conversation

81
00:03:52.541 --> 00:03:55.625
happening with the mind.

82
00:03:55.625 --> 00:03:57.333
Understand it like this –

83
00:03:57.333 --> 00:04:00.291
within your own mind, there are two parts.

84
00:04:00.291 --> 00:04:03.041
One that helps you,

85
00:04:03.041 --> 00:04:06.208
and one that leads to problems,

86
00:04:06.208 --> 00:04:08.416
discourages you.

87
00:04:08.416 --> 00:04:13.541
Encourage the helpful part of the mind.

88
00:04:13.541 --> 00:04:15.291
Imagine,

89
00:04:15.291 --> 00:04:18.041
if a close friend of yours

90
00:04:18.041 --> 00:04:21.375
is sad, troubled,

91
00:04:21.375 --> 00:04:25.666
will you tell them to give up?

92
00:04:25.666 --> 00:04:29.333
Will you tell them they are completely

93
00:04:29.333 --> 00:04:30.791
incompetent?

94
00:04:30.791 --> 00:04:32.125
No, right?

95
00:04:32.125 --> 00:04:34.041
You will boost their courage.

96
00:04:34.041 --> 00:04:36.916
You will remind them of their capabilities.

97
00:04:36.916 --> 00:04:39.333
You will give them encouragement.

98
00:04:39.333 --> 00:04:41.583
Now think –

99
00:04:41.583 --> 00:04:45.083
you are your own friend too, aren't you?

100
00:04:45.083 --> 00:04:49.583
Then why have negative 
conversations with yourself?

101
00:04:49.583 --> 00:04:52.791
Both forms are hidden in your mind –

102
00:04:52.791 --> 00:04:55.875
that of friend and that of enemy.

103
00:04:55.875 --> 00:05:02.041
Now the question arises: which
 one do you give more time to?

104
00:05:02.041 --> 00:05:05.541
Nourish the friend hidden in the mind.

105
00:05:05.541 --> 00:05:08.041
Keep the mind positive,

106
00:05:08.041 --> 00:05:12.041
and for this, both spirituality and yoga

107
00:05:12.041 --> 00:05:14.125
will be helpful.

108
00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:21.208
The mind can become a friend,

109
00:05:21.208 --> 00:05:23.458
the mind can become an enemy.

110
00:05:23.458 --> 00:05:26.250
The mind can suggest solutions,

111
00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:31.875
and it can also create new problems.

112
00:05:31.875 --> 00:05:34.375
And the surrounding environment

113
00:05:34.375 --> 00:05:37.583
has a big impact on mental state.

114
00:05:37.583 --> 00:05:42.708
Whether the surrounding
 environment is negative or positive,

115
00:05:42.708 --> 00:05:46.041
the mind's likelihood of going in that direction

116
00:05:46.041 --> 00:05:47.375
increases.

117
00:05:47.375 --> 00:05:51.708
Therefore, in social and family settings,

118
00:05:51.708 --> 00:05:54.833
two things are extremely important:

119
00:05:54.833 --> 00:05:58.250
First – what kind of environment

120
00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:01.333
are you adopting? And second –

121
00:06:01.333 --> 00:06:05.666
what kind of environment are you creating?

122
00:06:05.666 --> 00:06:09.625
Adopt a good environment, 
and create one too.

123
00:06:09.625 --> 00:06:13.250
Think – whether it's a group of friends

124
00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:15.916
or your family,

125
00:06:15.916 --> 00:06:19.791
what kind of environment is 
being created there?

126
00:06:19.791 --> 00:06:23.333
For every problem, instead of solutions,

127
00:06:23.333 --> 00:06:26.125
is there blame on others?

128
00:06:26.125 --> 00:06:28.750
Is there discussion only about others' sorrows

129
00:06:28.750 --> 00:06:32.125
and mistakes?

130
00:06:32.125 --> 00:06:34.583
In such a case, the mind will go
 toward blame, not improvement,

131
00:06:34.583 --> 00:06:38.458
will become discouraged,

132
00:06:38.458 --> 00:06:40.375
will learn only to doubt

133
00:06:40.375 --> 00:06:43.291
instead of trust others.

134
00:06:43.291 --> 00:06:45.291
And none of these

135
00:06:45.291 --> 00:06:48.458
are beneficial for you.

136
00:06:48.458 --> 00:06:51.708
Try not to create such a negative

137
00:06:51.708 --> 00:06:54.916
environment, nor remain in it.

138
00:06:54.916 --> 00:06:58.708
On the other hand, imagine a family

139
00:06:58.708 --> 00:07:01.000
or friends around you

140
00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:03.833
where only good things happen.

141
00:07:03.833 --> 00:07:05.083
Discussion on solutions,

142
00:07:05.083 --> 00:07:07.208
not problems.

143
00:07:07.208 --> 00:07:12.458
Talk about things worth 
learning from people, not their faults.

144
00:07:12.458 --> 00:07:15.250
In such good influence, your mind

145
00:07:15.250 --> 00:07:16.916
will become a well-wisher.

146
00:07:16.916 --> 00:07:18.791
It will lead you toward progress, love,

147
00:07:18.791 --> 00:07:20.958
and peace.

148
00:07:20.958 --> 00:07:25.000
So whether it's a group of friends or family,

149
00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:28.625
remember these two things again:

150
00:07:28.625 --> 00:07:31.083
Live in a positive environment,

151
00:07:31.083 --> 00:07:34.041
and create a positive environment.

152
00:07:34.041 --> 00:07:36.416
This will be favorable not only for your mind,

153
00:07:36.416 --> 00:07:39.583
but for the minds of your family members

154
00:07:39.583 --> 00:07:43.250
and loved ones too.

155
00:07:47.666 --> 00:07:49.166
Mental state

156
00:07:49.166 --> 00:07:52.583
affects every area of life.

157
00:07:52.583 --> 00:07:54.458
In professional life,

158
00:07:54.458 --> 00:07:56.750
the kind of environment people live in

159
00:07:56.750 --> 00:07:59.041
or create

160
00:07:59.041 --> 00:08:01.166
has a direct impact

161
00:08:01.166 --> 00:08:05.250
on the way they work and their morale.

162
00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:07.875
This is important for everyone to understand,

163
00:08:07.875 --> 00:08:09.666
and especially for those

164
00:08:09.666 --> 00:08:12.166
in leadership positions.

165
00:08:12.166 --> 00:08:16.083
If at your workplace there is only criticism,

166
00:08:16.083 --> 00:08:17.708
work pressure,

167
00:08:17.708 --> 00:08:21.458
talk only of competition, not emotions,

168
00:08:21.458 --> 00:08:22.791
then gradually

169
00:08:22.791 --> 00:08:25.333
everyone's mind will start to get discouraged.

170
00:08:25.333 --> 00:08:28.375
People will start doubting their abilities,

171
00:08:28.375 --> 00:08:31.208
will be afraid to think of something new.

172
00:08:31.208 --> 00:08:34.375
A person is like a plant –

173
00:08:34.375 --> 00:08:37.166
from time to time they need the fertilizer of guidance

174
00:08:37.166 --> 00:08:40.583
and the water of appreciation.

175
00:08:40.583 --> 00:08:42.958
If there is only harsh sunlight,

176
00:08:42.958 --> 00:08:45.750
this plant will wither.

177
00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:49.000
Their capacity to work will decrease.

178
00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:50.875
On the other hand, think –

179
00:08:50.875 --> 00:08:53.333
if there is encouragement at the workplace,

180
00:08:53.333 --> 00:08:54.833
priority is given not just to profit

181
00:08:54.833 --> 00:08:57.666
but also to feelings,

182
00:08:57.666 --> 00:09:00.416
during problems there 
is help instead of criticism,

183
00:09:00.416 --> 00:09:03.625
then everything will change.

184
00:09:03.625 --> 00:09:04.833
People will be inspired,

185
00:09:04.833 --> 00:09:06.375
will become positive,

186
00:09:06.375 --> 00:09:08.750
will consider themselves valuable.

187
00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:11.125
And all of this will have a direct impact

188
00:09:11.125 --> 00:09:15.458
on their productivity and 
the organization's progress.

189
00:09:15.458 --> 00:09:17.750
So think...

190
00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:20.041
What kind of environment are you creating

191
00:09:20.041 --> 00:09:22.416
for your colleagues?

192
00:09:22.416 --> 00:09:26.458
Do your words give people 
courage and confidence,

193
00:09:26.458 --> 00:09:28.208
or do they discourage

194
00:09:28.208 --> 00:09:30.333
and dishearten them?

195
00:09:30.333 --> 00:09:31.750
Think....
